<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz-E Q1 net up to PLN 0.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz-E Q1 net up to PLN 0.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elektromontaz Export SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     0.19   vs    0.81</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 0.76   vs    0.60</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.60   vs    0.36</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Elektromontaz Export SA. @</p>
<p>    net sales				7.00   vs   12.52</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 6.77   vs   11.70</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit/loss	  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.15   vs    0.25</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.12   vs    0.99</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.56   vs    1.19</p>
<p>    investment			     4.56   vs    4.73</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
